    "generator_parameters": [
      "scene_profile"
    ],
    "negative_constraints": [
      "Do not treat arbitrary blue objects as panels; a qualifying object must be an exact hollow rectangle border.",
      "Do not assume frame order from a fixed left-to-right strip; sort by top-left row and then column.",
      "Do not compare padded frame interiors directly; crop each interior tightly before inference.",
      "Do not infer from shape occupancy alone; transformations preserve the full colored grid pattern.",
      "Do not choose an arbitrary matching symmetry; transform-code order determines the first match.",
      "Do not return the whole C frame or its padding; return only transformed cropped C content.",
      "Do not generate empty-frame or missing-frame bypasses as training lessons."
    ],
    "ambiguity_notes": "Transform order is semantic for symmetric panels: identity is code 1, then clockwise, 180, transpose, left-right, and up-down. Generalized non-identity lessons make the first matching code unique and make its effect on C visible; identity remains a valid analogy branch rather than a ruleless degenerate.",
